- **Verification:** PNG is non-empty (625 KB > 50 KB) and matches expected 2400×3000 dimensions; SVG validated as well-formed XML; rendered PNG read back and visually inspected. First render exposed several text-overflow issues (main headline clip, gauge header, tier-2 amber flag overlapping its label, tier-5 multiplier text crossing the board edge, a grace-note line and the footer prose running off the right edge); all were corrected (font sizes/positions trimmed, board 5 widened, footer split to two lines) and re-inspected clean on the second render.
- One mid-edit truncated the SVG tail (closing tags lost); detected via the XML parse error and repaired before final render.

